  inv("advancedImaging", "MRCP or EUS", "Magnetic resonance imaging (MRI) of the biliary tree, or EUS", "CBD stones", "No duct stones", "Stone size, number, location and CBD diameter", "Investigation of choice and roadmap for ERCP or surgery (ICMR STW).", "gsurg", CB),
