  step("surgery", "Surgical options", "If ERCP fails", ["Laparoscopic or open cholecystectomy with CBD exploration (ICMR STW).", "CBD closure: primary, T-tube, primary with endobiliary stent (remove within 6 weeks) or drainage procedure (ICMR STW).", "Bypass (choledochoduodenostomy, hepaticojejunostomy) for multiple stones, hepatolithiasis, CBD over 2 cm or ampullary stricture (ICMR STW)."]),
